RESULT
Keep this bounded board-only framebuffer/USB-peripheral series unchanged.
Peripheral-only is a deliberate first-boot restriction, not a hardware OTG
limitation. OTG needs a separate SMB1360 power/sensing follow-up and coordinated
phone validation; merely changing dr_mode would be premature.

